background: #6BA644; color: white; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold;\">✓</div>\n<p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Timeline mapping from consultation to first shipment</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 14px; margin: 0 0 18px;\">\n<div style=\"flex-shrink: 0; width: 26px; height: 26px; background: #6BA644; color: white; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold;\">✓</div>\n<p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Direct answers to your technical and operational questions</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 14px; margin: 0 0 18px;\">\n<div style=\"flex-shrink: 0; width: 26px; height: 26px; background: #6BA644; color: white; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold;\">✓</div>\n<p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Clear next step recommendation (whether we work together or not)</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"},"child_css":{},"css":{},"id":216201609268,"order":4,"styles":{},"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div id=\"get-started\" style=\"background: #e6e5e3; padding: 80px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Ready to launch your private label supplement line?</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 32px;\">Schedule a consultation. We will walk through your audience, the right formulations for them, branding options, and the timeline.</p>\n    <a href=\"#get-started\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #6BA644; color: white; padding: 16px 40px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Schedule a Consultation</a>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"child_css":{},"css":{},"id":216201609269,"order":5,"styles":{},"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: white; padding: 90px 20px;\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr; gap: 56px; align-items: center;\">\n<div><img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/PRIVATELABEL.png\" width=\"475\" height=\"253\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"PRIVATELABEL\" style=\"width: 475px; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(1,38,56,.15); max-width: 100%;\"></div>\n<div>\n<p style=\"color: #6ba644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">NEW TO PRIVATE LABEL</p>\n<h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 20px;\">Get the free Definitive Guide to Private Labeling</h2>\n<p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 28px;\">If you are new to private labeling supplements and want to learn more about how to build your brand with our manufacturing team, download our free Definitive Guide. You will get answers to the most frequently asked questions about private labeling, plus tips and step-by-step instructions to make your new product launch easy, successful, and profitable.</p>\n<a href=\"/guide-definitive-private-label\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #6BA644; color: white; padding: 14px 32px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Download the Guide</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>"},"child_css":{},"css":{},"id":216201609270,"order":6,"styles":{},"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #e6e5e3; padding: 90px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">50+ YEARS OF SUPPLEMENT MANUFACTURING</p>\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 24px;\">Developed by us. Made for you.</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">With over 50 years in the health supplement industry, we are one of the most trusted dietary supplement manufacturers. Every private label supplement we produce is doctor-formulated using thoroughly researched ingredients, then scientifically reviewed for efficacy and quality before it ever enters production in our U.S. facilities.</p>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">FoodScience is an FDA-registered food facility, GMP certified to SQF food safety standards, and certified to NSF GMP 455-2.</p>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 40px;\">When you partner with us, our expert team is with you every step of the way. Help your customers find what they want from a source they trust. You.</p>\n    <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 50px; justify-content: center; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_Logo_SQF.png\" alt=\"SQF Certified\" style=\"height: 80px; width: auto;\"/>\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/NSF.png\" alt=\"NSF GMP Certified\" style=\"height: 80px; width: auto;\"/>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"child_css":{},"css":{},"id":216201609271,"order":7,"styles":{},"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 80px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Frequently asked questions</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 17px; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 44px;\">None</p>\n    <details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>What happens in the consultation?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">We discuss your business goals, your audience, what you're considering launching, and the right path forward. The goal is to leave the call with clarity, not a pitch. If private label is the right move we say so. If it isn't, we say that too.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Do I need to prepare anything before the call?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Helpful but not required: a rough sense of which supplement categories interest you, what budget range you're working with, and your timeline. We can have a productive call without any prep if you're still in exploration mode.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Will I be on a call with a salesperson?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">You'll be on a call with a private label specialist who can speak to manufacturing, quality, design, and business considerations. We're consultative, not high-pressure sales. The team is incentivized on long-term client success, not closing rates.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Can multiple people from my team join?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Yes. If your decision involves a co-founder, marketing lead, or other stakeholder, bring them. Group calls often surface better questions and align everyone on the path forward.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>What if I'm not ready to commit after the call?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">That's normal and expected. Most clients take 2-4 weeks to evaluate after their first conversation. We follow up periodically without pressure. You move at the pace that works for you.</div>\n    </details>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"child_css":{},"css":{},"id":216201609272,"order":8,"styles":{},"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #012638; padding: 28px 24px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;\">\n    <p style=\"color: rgba(255,255,255,.78); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; letter-spacing: .2px;\">\n      These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. These products are not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. Information on this site is provided for informational purposes only and is not intended as a substitute for advice from your physician or other health care professional.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"child_css":{},"css":{},"id":216201609273,"order":9,"styles":{},"type":"rich_text"}]}},"widgets":{}}